            <div xml:id="m-10f0c27c-17c9-48e3-b634-85c753887460">
              <lg xml:id="m-0e616fe2-e660-4cc6-9b3a-d1b9f7eb6cf1">
                <l xml:id="m-4c7ed193-1147-45da-9469-106cf4883cda" facs="#m-4717d7e7-4fc2-477e-bd74-d364cbccc991" label="ambiguous">1400</l><l xml:id="m-bfee284f-c97c-4051-8bbf-fd39fe0c5b1a" facs="#m-84a77943-3b68-4ab0-bd28-013258792186" label="ambiguous">March 19.</l><l xml:id="m-fe58b663-4ee9-46cc-8bf1-2a963042997f" facs="#m-5580938a-d72d-440b-a821-7947587d4df8" label="ambiguous">† Sequentia sancti Evangelii secundum Matthaeum. Matta. To.</l><l xml:id="m-95751f49-1768-4340-a4c4-f20ac30f7839" facs="#m-61196752-5e54-4121-9ecf-69f496cd9240" label="lyrics-like">TN illo témpore: Dixit Jesus disci-ltimuéritis eos. Nihil enim est opér¬</l><l xml:id="m-321bbe1b-e0b0-4ada-a94f-642ac229f049" facs="#m-0e355b36-da7e-48bc-8997-8c7691c6f996" label="lyrics-like"> pulis suis : Cum persequéntur vos</l><l xml:id="m-493b0d12-f700-4c40-a7e6-38969693dd49" facs="#m-1c9ecc88-5e13-4905-8247-20f830f8c160" label="lyrics-like">tum, quod non revelábitur; et</l><l xml:id="m-18a08a68-7a96-4082-b0ed-760cd89701b7" facs="#m-c0386d6d-58b4-4500-945f-190c2cd17c4f" label="lyrics-like">in civitáte ista, fúgite in áliam.</l><l xml:id="m-7cd7a055-a7ba-47b1-a1ee-618b829caed4" facs="#m-131eaa69-5a8c-4ade-9c4f-c937192bbcc1" label="lyrics-like">occúltum, quod non sciétur. Quod</l><l xml:id="m-e1cd437f-c8b7-42f9-8ac1-96fc06e427eb" facs="#m-cf72fccb-0b01-4e5b-a44e-35c0b5bc7f88" label="lyrics-like">Amen dico vobis, non consummá¬</l><l xml:id="m-f90f4e14-32e7-4116-9fed-a589d14fd29a" facs="#m-c5b63faf-dc47-4988-acb4-5938a1a0e043" label="lyrics-like">dico vobis in ténebris, dicite in</l><l xml:id="m-51369448-dd54-4061-bcdc-2683661507ac" facs="#m-bea0b48a-5850-44ad-85e0-bf4658317ea5" label="lyrics-like">bitis civitátes Israel, donec véniat</l><l xml:id="m-82263f31-1bca-4b16-a16e-eecd4b8d3542" facs="#m-c29d84c0-d63c-48ba-89a0-9b009609e464" label="lyrics-like">lúmine: et quod in aure audítis,</l><l xml:id="m-d9ad0c74-691a-4cf5-a909-311f6ede2d2f" facs="#m-b33b832e-47bb-4ff0-b3b7-f3d36a19cf0e" label="lyrics-like">Filius hóminis. Non est discípulus</l><l xml:id="m-70343b27-b5a7-4fb4-830e-bce9fb8ce8a9" facs="#m-925a62b9-e951-4a57-b27b-23177838bb24" label="lyrics-like">praedicáte super tecta. Et nolite</l><l xml:id="m-149de510-2f60-4ea7-8292-a5818ece694d" facs="#m-a31bd9e8-1964-4a4a-aad4-b2479c149046" label="ambiguous">super magistrum, nec servus super</l><l xml:id="m-6afe356b-e3e1-4a88-ae10-9d8d1f1d115d" facs="#m-1dde4445-27c4-47dc-8ede-7330c3c73562" label="lyrics-like">timére eos qui occídunt corpus, áni¬</l><l xml:id="m-1b7110a9-77d5-409d-855a-3b95dcbcf3b6" facs="#m-015cb6b9-3881-43f5-a62b-ee814cf518a4" label="lyrics-like">dóminum suum. Súfficit discípulo,</l><l xml:id="m-f6684dbe-d29c-4fe8-9d5d-718a1e9f0bb2" facs="#m-a9039635-d101-4faa-ab62-dbc63f89dc0b" label="ambiguous">mam autem non possunt occidere:</l><l xml:id="m-2502d316-d132-493f-bdcb-8688a79b12ab" facs="#m-89d84280-46d5-4174-b76b-74dc7a425f4a" label="ambiguous">ut sit sicut magister ejus: et servo,</l><l xml:id="m-3b81f6b1-83f0-436f-a6d5-3a6c7d9d230a" facs="#m-11f68b29-4f22-4987-88c4-36761e63cb44" label="lyrics-like">sed pótius timéte eum qui potest</l><l xml:id="m-77ed022b-30f7-4fbd-bc4f-ca98204847d8" facs="#m-58e2763d-c32c-4b8f-9236-9bb47e503a67" label="lyrics-like">sicut dóminus éjus. Si patremfamí¬</l><l xml:id="m-0545f0da-67f6-4a4c-b93c-704deb3138ff" facs="#m-1a70667e-3c64-4dda-94cc-7de9808c31ae" label="lyrics-like">et ánimam et corpus pérdere in</l><l xml:id="m-e75acc8d-05ab-4f09-bcef-6c296e4f8e5b" facs="#m-1f68938d-f7e3-4c8e-9362-440547474997" label="lyrics-like">lias Beélzebub vocavérunt, quanto</l><l xml:id="m-8470ff3a-a347-4e2b-9746-82140b6e174e" facs="#m-20cb4a3c-9d08-4941-85e1-1e51ec6a7e6a" label="lyrics-like">gehénnam.</l><l xml:id="m-9f573c4e-1750-4451-9e1a-16dcf28bcf55" facs="#m-4109b459-3d92-4273-a943-31acf402a7d2" label="ambiguous">Credo.</l><l xml:id="m-75d5f46c-f202-4e3e-91d1-5af743df2f2b" facs="#m-3a8ae33d-25c3-42c8-93a0-ecf9537ce778" label="lyrics-like">magis domésticos ejus? Ne ergo</l><l xml:id="m-d8d1f847-28cc-4f5e-85ad-96d765a5c83c" facs="#m-feca8de0-0e1f-4465-9e93-3b7fd710adb2" label="ambiguous">Secret.</l><l xml:id="m-6fca7aff-c4a3-4173-9078-d7c5b23fb03d" facs="#m-44307ec6-9a9d-4651-af37-4aeae22cc271" label="lyrics-like">Espice, Dómine, immaculátam ] ficis et Confessóris tui Cyrilli, eam</l><l xml:id="m-e4915069-822e-42bd-9fd1-9c07a48e9161" facs="#m-7d65ccc5-4f73-417c-9ccf-720dd410b79d" label="lyrics-like">Lt hóstiam, quam tibi offérimus: mundo corde suscípere studeámus.</l><l xml:id="m-4aada0ed-ad22-4936-93b2-44226b2f5e9b" facs="#m-ae761865-a8d7-4ae8-a9dc-281c48693e9f" label="lyrics-like">et praesta; ut méritis beáti Ponti-]Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-53d48df3-3526-413e-8079-6be41199e50e" facs="#m-e60a5b8e-c95a-424d-8483-9ee86f4fbc50" label="ambiguous">Postcommunion.</l><l xml:id="m-f25552d3-2a90-4ff0-8417-32ed71f95ebb" facs="#m-4428596a-531a-44b1-967e-8ae5c91baa46" label="lyrics-like">NAcraménta Córporis et Sángui-nostra sanctíficent : ut divínae con¬</l><l xml:id="m-81abde49-258d-479e-bc21-af53abb07e43" facs="#m-2a5972b4-8a7e-4e28-affd-b9b020bf5786" label="lyrics-like">O nis tui quae súmpsimus, Dómi¬atúrae éffici mereámur : Qui</l><l xml:id="m-528733fc-165c-4934-92e9-ce4f64d1f5e7" facs="#m-68f78526-ca48-49fb-8050-0a9e0ea1b65d" label="lyrics-like">ne Jesu Christe, beáti Cyrílli Pon-vivis et regnas.</l><l xml:id="m-fa152691-1353-4b5e-bfc9-f9c53361379e" facs="#m-da0018ad-2344-4820-9339-d62e95a2d4d7" label="lyrics-like">tificis précibus, mentes et corda</l><l xml:id="m-29693bbf-626c-49b6-aa0b-a904343742e5" facs="#m-798f40f5-57b8-41a8-b4af-8e474010766b" label="ambiguous">    SURRTRO ONCNOR RRARCR=</l><l xml:id="m-a9cc30b6-f3d4-427a-828e-809f69394e08" facs="#m-c56869b7-6c8b-43e9-bac4-9c9b3726dbb0" label="ambiguous">ST. JOSEPH,</l><l xml:id="m-1da329dd-e1d9-45e6-be2e-32239c486e21" facs="#m-51a807d0-97f5-49da-a51e-887281b780ef" label="text-like">Spouse of the Blessed Virgin Mary.</l><l xml:id="m-83a7e2ae-08e8-4293-9843-1ac3c2661696" facs="#m-c5e410f8-4396-4c72-b212-c7ab61f98691" label="ambiguous">First Class.</l><l xml:id="m-6e07b108-29cb-4a0b-868c-5ab9130a5579" facs="#m-d6a77b91-dc53-48cc-b6b6-10bd87b7f078" label="text-like">AT FIRST VESPERS.</l><l xml:id="m-81060ad6-f258-4471-91c4-be5dd6a6a3c6" facs="#m-470ebed6-b9c0-4152-82ed-6c6997d555d2" label="lyrics-like">Psatms. 1. Dixit Dóminus. I. g. p. 128.— 2. Confitébor. 2. D. p. 134.—</l><l xml:id="m-6d5f0154-ee22-4207-851a-50264f94c9c9" facs="#m-f62d5419-079a-4190-b322-2ac05dae2644" label="lyrics-like">3. Beátus vir. 3. a'. p. 143.— 4. Laudáte púeri. 4. E. p. 150. — 5. Laudáte</l><l xml:id="m-16df5c53-5fb8-4f88-bc1a-d418e873c6d1" facs="#m-935ec8a7-6072-4986-8545-a123d31dce8a" label="lyrics-like">Dóminum. S. a. p. 168.</l><l xml:id="m-624d52d4-154e-42d1-8e82-cea0a6a64079" facs="#m-201e6b2e-5a90-4e94-b4f6-42ef97840436" label="ambiguous">1. Ant.8</l><l xml:id="m-e09d06da-5258-4a29-8726-0cebe9675625" facs="#m-e9439ea2-978c-452b-b6be-ef3c8a8730c1" label="ambiguous">1.g</l><l xml:id="m-29d1d5a6-a43e-4cf1-9df1-15dd08d76a3c" facs="#m-e340caa9-d245-47b0-a429-bf7b971a685f" label="lyrics-like">Acob autem “ génu-it Jó-seph, ví-rum Mari¬ae,</l><l xml:id="m-b57c7422-f4e1-44c1-8633-53948a723e1c" facs="#m-26b6f906-5f32-4f97-826b-c666a3803993" label="lyrics-like">de qua nátus est Jé-sus, qui vo-cá-tur Chrístus. P. T. Alle¬</l><l xml:id="m-ee2e7c2c-8abc-4155-beb1-8c0f4f67d8b2" facs="#m-d4a30221-d493-4d17-a5ce-247d53d01c5c" label="ambiguous">2. Ant.</l><l xml:id="m-0628927d-cbc8-4884-ac0b-2f4ae93c7256" facs="#m-04cbf1d0-4802-4456-ac5d-fccf3247ef4f" label="ambiguous">2.D</l><l xml:id="m-a0133dcc-3093-489a-b3f4-e081ce3e84c6" facs="#m-d6fada50-bc54-4c96-b352-3b9fed293cdc" label="ambiguous">m</l><l xml:id="m-a8dd670c-411d-49ff-b0af-46c2378c4314" facs="#m-1b48a617-a991-4f9b-a0af-2f28c19ce6ea" label="lyrics-like">lú-ia. Eu o u a e.</l><l xml:id="m-cc75c405-d4b5-427f-92ec-5869ceeda4a5" facs="#m-7be78a62-c86e-4367-b51f-2450aecc0354" label="lyrics-like">Issus est “ Ange-lus Gá¬</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
      </mdiv>
    </body>
  </music>
</mei>